{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/61233a096446b574d1028dbaaf15c4e4.avif?t=1754603906\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carhem is an online party game, featuring physics based combat with cars. You and up to 7 friends battle it out for victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/9f3d059841e62f6876d2d4c7a7c30925.avif?t=1754603906\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.poster.avif?t=1754603906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.webm?t=1754603906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.mp4?t=1754603906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only way to win is to outlast your opponents. Make sure you get to the circle on time to stay alive! \u2026 And be careful not to fall off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/1fe65a12da5e72be42b79ef0de69f0ea.avif?t=1754603906\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/24da983307b6f050445aaa103bd6c938.poster.avif?t=1754603906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/24da983307b6f050445aaa103bd6c938.webm?t=1754603906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/24da983307b6f050445aaa103bd6c938.mp4?t=1754603906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carhem features nearly a dozen unique cars, and each of them has a unique play style and ability. Want bigger critical hits to focus on killing your opponents? You got it. Want extra speed for survivability? That\u2019s an option too.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/af2111ef6f3108c355ab5e921cdb783b.avif?t=1754603906\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/d2a57e35b5bcfd6ab44788d3877f9b4d.poster.avif?t=1754603906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/d2a57e35b5bcfd6ab44788d3877f9b4d.webm?t=1754603906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/d2a57e35b5bcfd6ab44788d3877f9b4d.mp4?t=1754603906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics based combat naturally allows for funny moments to occur. Especially if you give the golf cart a good whack\u2026 Just be sure you aren\u2019t hitting your teammates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, are you ready for some <span class=\"bb_strike\">mayhem</span>\u00a0<i><strong>Carhem</strong></i>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1754603906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1754603906","capsule